--
--    Copyright (c) Callum Brieske / NSL NZ
--    https://github.com/callumbrieske/Q-Sys-Advanced-UCI-Controller
--    Released under the GNU General Public License v3.0
--
--  The runtime here has been substantially rewritten - the visibility model,
--  the permission mask, the PIN layer and the whole configuration grid are new
--  work - but it began as a drop-in replacement for that plugin in designs
--  that were already running it, and it keeps its control names (enable,
--  layer, radio group, parent, transition in/out, reset on parent, visible,
--  uci, page, status, reset, logical parent) so that a commissioned venue
--  upgrades without rewiring.  The transition and group-colour tables are
--  carried over unchanged.  That makes it a derived work, and it is therefore
--  distributed under the same licence.
